Current bill calculation ante, general ga manam slab system ni follow avtham. Ante, ekkuva units vadithe per unit cost perugutundi.

Ikkada oka simple C program undi. Idi user nunchi `units` ni input ga teesukoni, standard slab rates (example kosam) prakaram bill calculate chestundi.

```c
#include <stdio.h>

int main() {
    int units;
    float bill = 0;

    printf("Enter the number of units consumed: ");
    scanf("%d", &units);

    // Simple Slab Logic:
    // 0-100 units: Rs 2.00 per unit
    // 101-200 units: Rs 4.00 per unit
    // Above 200 units: Rs 6.00 per unit

    if (units <= 100) {
        bill = units * 2.0;
    } 
    else if (units <= 200) {
        bill = (100 * 2.0) + ((units - 100) * 4.0);
    } 
    else {
        bill = (100 * 2.0) + (100 * 4.0) + ((units - 200) * 6.0);
    }

    printf("Total Electricity Bill: Rs %.2f\n", bill);

    return 0;
}
```

### Code lo em jarugutundi?
1. **Input:** User nunchi `units` ni integer ga teesukunnam.
2. **Logic (`if-else`):**
   - Modati 100 units ki unit ki 2 rupayalu lekka vestundi.
   - 101 nunchi 200 varaku unna units ki, unit ki 4 rupayalu.
   - 200 daatithe, aa extra units ki 6 rupayalu charge avthundi.
3. **Output:** Final bill ni `float` format lo print chestundi.

**Note:** Nee college assignment lo emaina specific slab rates (e.g., 0-50 units ki free, etc.) unte, avi ikkada values lo change cheskunte saripothundi.

Edaina doubt unte adugu, explain chestanu!

HTML, CSS, inka JavaScript vadithe manam oka simple **"Square Dodger"** game cheyochu. Ikkada goal entante: Nee square ni mouse tho move chestu, paina nundi vache obstacles (falling blocks) nundi thappinchukovali.

Idi code:

### 1. HTML (index.html)
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Simple 2D Game</title>
    <style>
        canvas { border: 2px solid #000; background: #f0f0f0; display: block; margin: 0 auto; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <canvas id="gameCanvas" width="400" height="400"></canvas>
    <script src="game.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```

### 2. JavaScript (game.js)
```javascript
const canvas = document.getElementById("gameCanvas");
const ctx = canvas.getContext("2d");

let player = { x: 180, y: 350, size: 40 };
let enemy = { x: Math.random() * 360, y: 0, size: 40, speed: 5 };
let score = 0;

canvas.addEventListener("mousemove", (e) => {
    player.x = e.clientX - canvas.offsetLeft - 20;
});

function update() {
    enemy.y += enemy.speed;
    if (enemy.y > 400) {
        enemy.y = 0;
        enemy.x = Math.random() * 360;
        score++;
        enemy.speed += 0.2; // Game difficulty perugutundi
    }

    // Collision detection
    if (enemy.y + enemy.size > player.y && 
        enemy.x < player.x + player.size && 
        enemy.x + enemy.size > player.x) {
        alert("Game Over! Score: " + score);
        enemy.y = 0;
        score = 0;
        enemy.speed = 5;
    }
}

function draw() {
    ctx.clearRect(0, 0, 400, 400);
    ctx.fillStyle = "blue";
    ctx.fillRect(player.x, player.y, player.size, player.size);
    ctx.fillStyle = "red";
    ctx.fillRect(enemy.x, enemy.y, enemy.size, enemy.size);
    ctx.fillStyle = "black";
    ctx.fillText("Score: " + score, 10, 20);
}

function loop() {
    update();
    draw();
    requestAnimationFrame(loop);
}

loop();
```

### Ela run cheyali?
1. Nee computer lo oka folder create cheyi.
2. `index.html` ani oka file create chesi, first code snippet paste cheyi.
3. `game.js` ani inkoka file create chesi, second code snippet paste cheyi.
4. `index.html` file ni Chrome lo open cheyi.

**Em chestundi idi?**
* **Movement:** Nee mouse position batti blue square move avthundi.
* **Logic:** Red block paina nundi kinda ki padutundi. Adi nee square ni touch chesthe "Game Over" ani vastundi.
* **Difficulty:** Score perige koddi red

Sure, Pranav! Single file lo run cheyadaniki, HTML code lone `<style>` (CSS kosam) and `<script>` (JS kosam) tags ni add chesi full code ikkada isthunnanu.

Nuvvu ee code ni copy chesi, [W3Schools Tryit Editor](https://www.w3schools.com/html/tryit.asp?filename=tryhtml_default) lo paste chesi 'Run' nokku, game work avthundi.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        canvas { background: #f0f0f0; border: 2px solid #333; display: block; margin: 0 auto; cursor: none; }
        body { text-align: center; font-family: sans-serif; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h2>Square Dodger!</h2>
    <canvas id="gameCanvas" width="400" height="400"></canvas>

    <script>
        const canvas = document.getElementById("gameCanvas");
        const ctx = canvas.getContext("2d");

        let player = { x: 180, y: 350, size: 40 };
        let enemy = { x: Math.random() * 360, y: 0, size: 40, speed: 5 };
        let score = 0;

        canvas.addEventListener("mousemove", (e) => {
            let rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();
            player.x = e.clientX - rect.left - 20;
        });

        function update() {
            enemy.y += enemy.speed;
            if (enemy.y > 400) {
                enemy.y = 0;
                enemy.x = Math.random() * 360;
                score++;
                enemy.speed += 0.2; 
            }

            if (enemy.y + enemy.size > player.y && 
                enemy.x < player.x + player.size && 
                enemy.x + enemy.size > player.x) {
                alert("Game Over! Nee Score: " + score);
                enemy.y = 0;
                score = 0;
                enemy.speed = 5;
            }
        }

        function draw() {
            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, 400, 400);
            // Player
            ctx.fillStyle = "blue";
            ctx.fillRect(player.x, player.y, player.size, player.size);
            // Enemy
            ctx.fillStyle = "red";
            ctx.fillRect(enemy.x, enemy.y, enemy.size, enemy.size);
            // Score
            ctx.fillStyle = "black";
            ctx.font = "20px Arial";
            ctx.fillText("Score: " + score, 10, 30);
        }

        function loop() {
            update();
            draw();
            requestAnimationFrame(loop);
        }

        loop();
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

**Instruction:**
1. Paina unna code mothanni copy cheyi.
2. [W3Schools Online Editor](https://www.w3schools.com/html/tryit.asp?filename=tryhtml_default) ki vellu.
3. Left side unna code ni delete chesi, idi paste cheyi.
